### hostname default
hostname
--- out
QS400.EXAMPLE.COM

### hostname short
hostname -s
--- out
QS400

### hostname set refused
hostname newname
--- err
hostname: The host name cannot be set here; use the CHGTCPDMN command.
--- status
2

### hostname bad option
hostname -x
--- err
hostname: Option -x is not valid.
--- status
2

### hostname in substitution
h=$(hostname); echo "[$h]"
--- out
[QS400.EXAMPLE.COM]

